// Spread and park, the first of the paper's three opening programs: allocate
// |0>, apply one Hadamard, discard.  The temporary parks on |+> and the
// denotation factors, so the criterion of this work admits the drop; Silq's
// automatic forget inspects the producer instead, and H is not qfree.
def main(){
	t := H(0:𝔹);
	forget(t);
	return 0:𝔹;
}
